<title>THAILAND: Ten Thais die in road accident.</title>
<headline>Ten Thais die in road accident.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ten Thais were killed and five others injured on Tuesday in a collision involving two speeding vans in a northern Thai town, police said.</p>
<p>The accident occurred late in the morning at Banpotpisai district of Nakorn Sawan province about 240 km (146 miles) north of Bangkok.</p>
<p>Police said they were investigating the cause of accident.</p>
